## Requirements

- Python 3.12+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)

## Setup

```bash
uv sync --all-groups
uv run pre-commit install
```

## Quality

```bash
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run mypy src
```

## Build

```bash
uv build
```

